  "section": "37",
  "quote": "(5) An agreement between a landlord and tenant to terminate a tenancy is void if it is entered into, (a) at the time the tenancy agreement is entered into; or (b) as a condition of entering into the tenancy agreement.",
  "reason": "The clause is an agreement between the landlord and tenant to terminate the tenancy made at the time and as a condition of entering into the tenancy agreement, which is explicitly void under subsection 37(5) of the Act."
}

